- Credentials (disposable/public):
  - Account A: `adoringjepsen1@fearlessmails.com` / `Acd3423@#345566` — AccountID `3000823185`, user `test-user-123`.
  - Account B: `testt456` / `Acd3423@#345` — AccountID `3001021825`. Logged in on page 2 with `isolatedContext=userB`.
- Environment: Chrome `156.0.8078.73`; DevTools endpoint `http://127.0.0.1:9222`; `chrome-devtools` MCP; node v22.23.4; curl/jq/python3; **no ripgrep (`rg`)** — use grep/python.
