- Route inventory: `/dts`, `/datasource`, `/datasynchronizationv2` (+detail), `/datasubscriptionv2` (+detail), `/datavalidation` (+detail), `/tasksearch` (+`/detail/:id`), `/datamigrationv2/detail(/:id)`, `/overview`, `/createV2`, `/dflow`, `/etl-playground`, `/event`, `/modifyOrder`, `/params`, `/redirect`, `/subscriptiontasksearch`, `/synchronizationtasksearch`, `/assessment/detail`, `/datareplay/detail`.
